  "description": "UPDATE-USER-INFO's SECOND arm at app/cbl/COUSR02C.cbl:186-191, reached by PF5 with a user id present and FNAMEI blank. 'First Name can NOT be empty...' is issued, the cursor moves to FNAMEL and the screen is sent once. The whole IF NOT ERR-FLG-ON block at :215-245 is skipped, so the read never happens, the four change tests never run and no write is attempted.\n\nThe blank is LOW-VALUES, matching the 'SPACES OR LOW-VALUES' condition the source actually writes. Reaching this arm also requires the FIRST arm at :180 to have been evaluated and rejected, which is what makes the case an ordering proof as well as a coverage one: EVALUATE is ordered, the first matching WHEN wins, and a translation that reordered the tests would report the wrong message here while still reporting an error.",
